              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markaas dabadeedna anigu ruuxayga ayaan ku shubi doonaa dad oo dhan, oo wiilashiinna iyo hablihiinnu wax bay sii sheegi doonaan, oo odayaashiinnuna riyooyin bay ku riyoon doonaan, oo raggiinna dhallinyarada ahuna wax bay arki doonaan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
